  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  Chi2Var
  @  Variance of a normal population against a target value.
  @  Author & design           : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "Chi2Var: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → nv sdv sgv « nv 0 + sdv 0 + sgv 0 + → nn sd sg0 « '(nn-1)*sd^2/sg0^2' →Num 'nn-1' →Num → xv dfv « xv "chi2" →Tag dfv "df" →Tag dfv xv UTPC "p" →Tag nv sdv sgv 3 →List Drop » » »
